    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dooley Auctioneers are delighted to bring 33 The Green, Woodbrook Glen, Bray, Co. Wicklow to the open market.\r\n\r\nSituated in a quiet and private cul-de-sac within this mature and well-established development, No. 33 is a well-proportioned three-bedroom, two-bathroom home extending to approximately 89 sq.m. The property offers plenty of potential for its new owners and represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers looking to put their own stamp on a home in a highly convenient Bray location.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from its own private driveway providing off-street parking, along with gated side access leading to the rear garden. One of the standout features of the location is Woodbrook Golf Club, which is situated to the rear of the property, providing an attractive backdrop to this already peaceful residential setting.\r\n\r\nThe location of Woodbrook Glen has become increasingly appealing, particularly with the continued development of the surrounding area. Sea Gardens is close by and has introduced a range of new amenities to the locality, including the popular Glovers café, while Bray itself continues to offer an ever-growing selection of shopping, dining and leisure options.\r\n\r\nBray Central has added significantly to the town centre, with major retailers including Penneys and Sports Direct, together with cafés, restaurants and leisure facilities. Bray Main Street, the famous seafront and promenade, Bray Harbour and the town's excellent selection of independent cafés, restaurants and pubs are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThe property is also well positioned for commuters, with access to Bray DART Station, Dublin Bus services and the N11/M50, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and the surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nWith its quiet cul-de-sac position, private parking, side access and excellent location close to Woodbrook Golf Club and the growing amenities at Sea Gardens, 33 The Green offers an exciting opportunity to acquire a three-bedroom home with plenty of potential in an established Bray neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nPlease Note: The property requires a new gas-fired boiler, as the existing boiler is no longer operational."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
