        "Content": "Three-bedroom, two-bathroom home\r\nApprox. 89 sq.m\r\nQuiet and private cul-de-sac setting\r\nPrivate driveway with off-street parking\r\nGated side access to rear garden\r\nExcellent potential for first-time buyers\r\nWoodbrook Golf Club situated to the rear\r\nEasy access to Bray Seafront, DART and N11/M50\r\nPlease Note: The property requires a new gas-fired boiler, as the existing boiler is no longer operational."
      },
